{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerosurge</strong> is a fast-paced arcade flying game that puts you in control of an agile jet built for high-speed action. With ultra-responsive and fluid flight controls, every turn, boost, and drift feels smooth, precise, and incredibly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752970/extras/959589fe26a29ba3ccbf25df5cfa1ad5.poster.avif?t=1756649052\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752970/extras/959589fe26a29ba3ccbf25df5cfa1ad5.webm?t=1756649052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform flips, barrel-rolls and drifts with<strong> responsive, physics-based flight controls</strong>\u00a0that feel intuitive and precise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take\u00a0on\u00a0intense <strong>missions and challenges</strong> that put your flying skills to the test and reward you for taking risks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock\u00a0<strong>unique</strong> <strong>weapons and modules\u00a0</strong>to customize your jet to your preference, from nimble fighters to high-tech gunships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore\u00a0<strong>diverse</strong> <strong>planets</strong>\u00a0that present unique challenges and hazards</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752970?t=1756649052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752970/554396f9f6dc0237080a4ef58a7bab2dd37f57af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756649052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752970/cf9